## Architecture A - request mapping template for GET /orders/{id}
##
## Integration: Lambda (non-proxy / "custom"), function orders-get-order
## Content type: application/json
##
## API Gateway extracts the path parameter and hands the Lambda a document that matches
## com.eci.orders.adapter.lambda.custom.OrderIdInput. The function never sees a URL, a method or
## a header.
##
##   GET /orders/ORD-1001   ->   { "id": "ORD-1001" }
##
## escapeJavaScript is what keeps a hostile path such as /orders/a"b from producing broken JSON.
{
  "id": "$util.escapeJavaScript($input.params('id'))"
}
